config BR2_PACKAGE_UBOOT_A133
    bool "uboot-a133"
    depends on BR2_aarch64
    help
      U-Boot boot packages for Allwinner A133-based handheld devices.
      
      This package builds boot_package.fex files for various A133 devices:
      - TrimUI Smart Pro, TrimUI Brick
      - Powkiddy V90S, V20
      - MagicX Zero 28, Zero 40
      - Xu20 V32
      
      Each device gets its device tree compiled and packed with U-Boot
      components using Allwinner's dragonsecboot tool.
      
      The resulting boot packages are placed in:
      output/images/a133-boot-packages/<device>_boot_package.fex
